meta {
  name: Grant access to a resource
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{bffUrl}}/api/v1/grants
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "resource_id": "{{integrationId}}",
    "user_id": "{{granteeId}}",
    "level": "use"
  }
}

docs {
  It requires owner or admin. `level` accepts only `use` or `manage` — the edge
  refuses any other value with a 422, before spending a trip to the core.

  A resource with a credential is CLOSED by default: with no explicit grant nobody
  beyond owner/admin sees it. Content (a skill, a flow) is open within the
  organization, but changing it requires a grant (ADR-0013).
}
